  "duration_s": 375.235011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道中国古代最让人想不通的建筑是哪一座吗？有人说，故宫九千多间，房六百年没塌。有人说万里长城两万多公里，修了两千年错，故宫连乾五都挤不进去，长城也不是第一。真正做头把交椅的那座东西，不是宫殿，不是城墙，没有一块砖，没有一根铁。两千二百多年以前没停过到，今天还在给上千万人供水浇地，他就在四川，你天天听说他，但你从来没把它当成建筑来看。今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大最不可思议的建筑。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在停。第十名，四川逃平枪战，西汉时期就有了。在四川，阿坝澧县两千多年了，整个寨子全是石头垒的，没有图纸，没有吊车，没有水泥。最绝的是地底下挖了一套完整的暗渠水网，家家户户通水，人在无里就能取水，外人进来跟进了迷宫一样。一九三三年，迭西大地震，周围村子塌了大半，陶坪羌寨连墙皮都没掉几块。两千年前，一帮羌族老百姓用石头垒出来的寨子，把现代地震专家都看傻了。您说邪门不邪门儿？第九名，河北挖皇宫，北齐时候修的在邯郸歙县钟黄山一千四百多年了，一座四层楼阁，通高二十三米，不是盖在地上的，是挂在悬崖上的。怎么挂悬崖上凿了八个栓马鼻九根铁链，把楼阁跟崖壁拴在一起，平时铁链是松的，人一多楼往前倾，铁链崩的，跟弓弦一样，把楼稳住了。专家罗哲文先生说过，这用的是重心偏离安全律的原理，比比萨斜塔还早，当地老百姓给他起了个名叫活楼吊庙。第八名，福建洛阳桥北宋时候修的，在泉州洛阳江入海口快一千年了。这座桥建在江海交汇的地方底下，全是烂泥，根本打不了桩。古人想了个办法，在桥底下养牡蛎牡蛎壳一层一层粘，在桥基上把石头全浇住了，比水泥还结实。这叫种力固给法。全世界独一份建成以来，经历了多少次台风洪水地震，到现在汽车还在上面跑老祖宗的办法。你说土不土土，但他管用。第七名，浙江龙游石窟在衢州龙游县一个水塘底下藏着的。一九九二年，几个村民把水抽干底下冒出来，一大群人工凿出来的地下石窟，二十四个，最高的三十米，凿出来的石头将近一百万立方石窟。屋里没有文字，没有壁画，没有任何记载，谁凿的什么时候凿的，用什么凿的，为什么凿？全世界专家研究了二十多年，一个都答不上来，有人叫他世界第九大奇迹。你想想，两千年前的人在地下干这么大的工程，竟然一点痕迹都没留下。这事儿你上哪儿说了一句？第六名，河南登封观星台，元朝建的在登封告城镇，七百多年了郭守敬修的中国现存最古老的天文建筑，就这么一个十来米高的土台子加一根横梁。郭守敬靠他测出了授时力，一年三百六十五点二四二五天，跟现在全世界用的公历几乎一模一样，比欧洲人早了整整三百年。没有望远镜，没有计算机，没有卫星，一个人用一根棍和一个台子把天上的事儿算明白了，您说这脑袋瓜子是什么做的？从第十到第六名，枪寨用石头把地震扛住了，挖皇工用铁链。把楼阁拴在悬崖上洛阳桥，用牡蛎把桥粘在烂泥里。龙游石窟地底下挖了个没人能解释的泥登峰观星台，用一个土台子算出了功力，可他们还不是最邪乎的。接下来第五到第一名更离谱。有一座建筑，一块三百多吨的石头，是趁着冬天泼水洞，冰在上万人拉的滑板上运了七十公里土。郭进城的有一个工城，藏在地底下五千多公里，长让火焰山边上长出了葡萄，可坐在头把交椅上的那座没有一块砖，没有一根铁，两千二百多年，一天没写过到，今天还在给上千万人供水，他是哪座？他凭什么把故宫和长城都压下去了，下一集已经同步更新，现在直接点开我的头像，进入主页，他一条视频就是下一集点个关注，看看谁才是中国古代最不可思议的建筑。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 4530,
      "text": "你知道中国古代最让人想不通的建筑是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5230,
      "end_ms": 5910,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5950,
      "end_ms": 7930,
      "text": "故宫九千多间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7930,
      "end_ms": 9790,
      "text": "房六百年没塌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10050,
      "end_ms": 13010,
      "text": "有人说万里长城两万多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13470,
      "end_ms": 15770,
      "text": "修了两千年错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16730,
      "end_ms": 19130,
      "text": "故宫连乾五都挤不进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19850,
      "end_ms": 21150,
      "text": "长城也不是第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21950,
      "end_ms": 24990,
      "text": "真正做头把交椅的那座东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25730,
      "end_ms": 26550,
      "text": "不是宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26790,
      "end_ms": 27745,
      "text": "不是城墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29690,
      "end_ms": 30690,
      "text": "没有一块砖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31190,
      "end_ms": 32170,
      "text": "没有一根铁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32530,
      "end_ms": 34970,
      "text": "两千二百多年以前没停过到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34970,
      "end_ms": 37850,
      "text": "今天还在给上千万人供水浇地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38390,
      "end_ms": 39290,
      "text": "他就在四川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39630,
      "end_ms": 40970,
      "text": "你天天听说他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41050,
      "end_ms": 43670,
      "text": "但你从来没把它当成建筑来看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44610,
      "end_ms": 49470,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国古代十大最不可思议的建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50490,
      "end_ms": 54610,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00021",
      "start_ms": 54950,
      "end_ms": 56890,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57610,
      "end_ms": 58330,
      "text": "第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58630,
      "end_ms": 60675,
      "text": "四川逃平枪战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61530,
      "end_ms": 63435,
      "text": "西汉时期就有了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64310,
      "end_ms": 65050,
      "text": "在四川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65190,
      "end_ms": 67925,
      "text": "阿坝澧县两千多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68540,
      "end_ms": 70635,
      "text": "整个寨子全是石头垒的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71070,
      "end_ms": 71935,
      "text": "没有图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00029",
      "start_ms": 72200,
      "end_ms": 73000,
      "text": "没有吊车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73260,
      "end_ms": 74155,
      "text": "没有水泥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74660,
      "end_ms": 79240,
      "text": "最绝的是地底下挖了一套完整的暗渠水网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00032",
      "start_ms": 79280,
      "end_ms": 80745,
      "text": "家家户户通水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81090,
      "end_ms": 82725,
      "text": "人在无里就能取水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83180,
      "end_ms": 85395,
      "text": "外人进来跟进了迷宫一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86250,
      "end_ms": 87390,
      "text": "一九三三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87470,
      "end_ms": 88485,
      "text": "迭西大地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00037",
      "start_ms": 88890,
      "end_ms": 90545,
      "text": "周围村子塌了大半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91410,
      "end_ms": 94325,
      "text": "陶坪羌寨连墙皮都没掉几块。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94810,
      "end_ms": 95790,
      "text": "两千年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00040",
      "start_ms": 96050,
      "end_ms": 99655,
      "text": "一帮羌族老百姓用石头垒出来的寨子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100030,
      "end_ms": 102555,
      "text": "把现代地震专家都看傻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00042",
      "start_ms": 103010,
      "end_ms": 104425,
      "text": "您说邪门不邪门儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00043",
      "start_ms": 105710,
      "end_ms": 106365,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00044",
      "start_ms": 106780,
      "end_ms": 107965,
      "text": "河北挖皇宫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00045",
      "start_ms": 108260,
      "end_ms": 113885,
      "text": "北齐时候修的在邯郸歙县钟黄山一千四百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00046",
      "start_ms": 114660,
      "end_ms": 116425,
      "text": "一座四层楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00047",
      "start_ms": 117210,
      "end_ms": 118950,
      "text": "通高二十三米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00048",
      "start_ms": 118970,
      "end_ms": 120645,
      "text": "不是盖在地上的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120920,
      "end_ms": 122425,
      "text": "是挂在悬崖上的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00050",
      "start_ms": 123360,
      "end_ms": 129125,
      "text": "怎么挂悬崖上凿了八个栓马鼻九根铁链，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00051",
      "start_ms": 129390,
      "end_ms": 132025,
      "text": "把楼阁跟崖壁拴在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00052",
      "start_ms": 132900,
      "end_ms": 134575,
      "text": "平时铁链是松的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00053",
      "start_ms": 135140,
      "end_ms": 136925,
      "text": "人一多楼往前倾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00054",
      "start_ms": 137260,
      "end_ms": 138060,
      "text": "铁链崩的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00055",
      "start_ms": 138060,
      "end_ms": 139240,
      "text": "跟弓弦一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00056",
      "start_ms": 139360,
      "end_ms": 140385,
      "text": "把楼稳住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00057",
      "start_ms": 141020,
      "end_ms": 142925,
      "text": "专家罗哲文先生说过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00058",
      "start_ms": 143230,
      "end_ms": 146205,
      "text": "这用的是重心偏离安全律的原理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00059",
      "start_ms": 146720,
      "end_ms": 148285,
      "text": "比比萨斜塔还早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00060",
      "start_ms": 148690,
      "end_ms": 151665,
      "text": "当地老百姓给他起了个名叫活楼吊庙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00061",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 153515,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00062",
      "start_ms": 153840,
      "end_ms": 156490,
      "text": "福建洛阳桥北宋时候修的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00063",
      "start_ms": 156490,
      "end_ms": 160285,
      "text": "在泉州洛阳江入海口快一千年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00064",
      "start_ms": 161210,
      "end_ms": 165470,
      "text": "这座桥建在江海交汇的地方底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00065",
      "start_ms": 165470,
      "end_ms": 166395,
      "text": "全是烂泥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00066",
      "start_ms": 167120,
      "end_ms": 168365,
      "text": "根本打不了桩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00067",
      "start_ms": 169430,
      "end_ms": 170795,
      "text": "古人想了个办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00068",
      "start_ms": 171920,
      "end_ms": 177210,
      "text": "在桥底下养牡蛎牡蛎壳一层一层粘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00069",
      "start_ms": 177210,
      "end_ms": 179795,
      "text": "在桥基上把石头全浇住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00070",
      "start_ms": 180220,
      "end_ms": 181820,
      "text": "比水泥还结实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00071",
      "start_ms": 182180,
      "end_ms": 184100,
      "text": "这叫种力固给法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00072",
      "start_ms": 184820,
      "end_ms": 187340,
      "text": "全世界独一份建成以来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00073",
      "start_ms": 187340,
      "end_ms": 191860,
      "text": "经历了多少次台风洪水地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00074",
      "start_ms": 192920,
      "end_ms": 198045,
      "text": "到现在汽车还在上面跑老祖宗的办法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00075",
      "start_ms": 199990,
      "end_ms": 202590,
      "text": "你说土不土土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00076",
      "start_ms": 204570,
      "end_ms": 205530,
      "text": "但他管用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00077",
      "start_ms": 205730,
      "end_ms": 206370,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00078",
      "start_ms": 208150,
      "end_ms": 215050,
      "text": "浙江龙游石窟在衢州龙游县一个水塘底下藏着的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00079",
      "start_ms": 215830,
      "end_ms": 216950,
      "text": "一九九二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216950,
      "end_ms": 219910,
      "text": "几个村民把水抽干底下冒出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00081",
      "start_ms": 219910,
      "end_ms": 222470,
      "text": "一大群人工凿出来的地下石窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00082",
      "start_ms": 222930,
      "end_ms": 223770,
      "text": "二十四个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00083",
      "start_ms": 224130,
      "end_ms": 225390,
      "text": "最高的三十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00084",
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 229800,
      "text": "凿出来的石头将近一百万立方石窟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00085",
      "start_ms": 229860,
      "end_ms": 230740,
      "text": "屋里没有文字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00086",
      "start_ms": 231000,
      "end_ms": 231820,
      "text": "没有壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00087",
      "start_ms": 232080,
      "end_ms": 233300,
      "text": "没有任何记载，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00088",
      "start_ms": 233940,
      "end_ms": 236040,
      "text": "谁凿的什么时候凿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00089",
      "start_ms": 236460,
      "end_ms": 237540,
      "text": "用什么凿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00090",
      "start_ms": 237680,
      "end_ms": 238440,
      "text": "为什么凿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00091",
      "start_ms": 239100,
      "end_ms": 241445,
      "text": "全世界专家研究了二十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00092",
      "start_ms": 241930,
      "end_ms": 243010,
      "text": "一个都答不上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00093",
      "start_ms": 243110,
      "end_ms": 245795,
      "text": "有人叫他世界第九大奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00094",
      "start_ms": 246490,
      "end_ms": 247095,
      "text": "你想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00095",
      "start_ms": 247610,
      "end_ms": 250715,
      "text": "两千年前的人在地下干这么大的工程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00096",
      "start_ms": 251300,
      "end_ms": 253715,
      "text": "竟然一点痕迹都没留下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00097",
      "start_ms": 254650,
      "end_ms": 256265,
      "text": "这事儿你上哪儿说了一句？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00098",
      "start_ms": 256700,
      "end_ms": 257335,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00099",
      "start_ms": 257800,
      "end_ms": 259660,
      "text": "河南登封观星台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00100",
      "start_ms": 260040,
      "end_ms": 263375,
      "text": "元朝建的在登封告城镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00101",
      "start_ms": 263780,
      "end_ms": 270845,
      "text": "七百多年了郭守敬修的中国现存最古老的天文建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00102",
      "start_ms": 271210,
      "end_ms": 274095,
      "text": "就这么一个十来米高的土台子加一根横梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00103",
      "start_ms": 274670,
      "end_ms": 276965,
      "text": "郭守敬靠他测出了授时力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00104",
      "start_ms": 277250,
      "end_ms": 280830,
      "text": "一年三百六十五点二四二五天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00105",
      "start_ms": 280950,
      "end_ms": 284535,
      "text": "跟现在全世界用的公历几乎一模一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00106",
      "start_ms": 285130,
      "end_ms": 287725,
      "text": "比欧洲人早了整整三百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00107",
      "start_ms": 288270,
      "end_ms": 289230,
      "text": "没有望远镜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00108",
      "start_ms": 289450,
      "end_ms": 290470,
      "text": "没有计算机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00109",
      "start_ms": 290690,
      "end_ms": 291615,
      "text": "没有卫星，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00110",
      "start_ms": 292100,
      "end_ms": 297175,
      "text": "一个人用一根棍和一个台子把天上的事儿算明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00111",
      "start_ms": 298540,
      "end_ms": 300455,
      "text": "您说这脑袋瓜子是什么做的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00112",
      "start_ms": 301510,
      "end_ms": 302945,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00113",
      "start_ms": 303340,
      "end_ms": 305645,
      "text": "枪寨用石头把地震扛住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00114",
      "start_ms": 306490,
      "end_ms": 307715,
      "text": "挖皇工用铁链。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00115",
      "start_ms": 308050,
      "end_ms": 310810,
      "text": "把楼阁拴在悬崖上洛阳桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00116",
      "start_ms": 310810,
      "end_ms": 313510,
      "text": "用牡蛎把桥粘在烂泥里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00117",
      "start_ms": 314290,
      "end_ms": 318970,
      "text": "龙游石窟地底下挖了个没人能解释的泥登峰观星台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00118",
      "start_ms": 319210,
      "end_ms": 321830,
      "text": "用一个土台子算出了功力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00119",
      "start_ms": 322590,
      "end_ms": 324230,
      "text": "可他们还不是最邪乎的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00120",
      "start_ms": 324970,
      "end_ms": 327410,
      "text": "接下来第五到第一名更离谱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00121",
      "start_ms": 328310,
      "end_ms": 329390,
      "text": "有一座建筑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00122",
      "start_ms": 329610,
      "end_ms": 331310,
      "text": "一块三百多吨的石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00123",
      "start_ms": 331310,
      "end_ms": 333210,
      "text": "是趁着冬天泼水洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00124",
      "start_ms": 333210,
      "end_ms": 337900,
      "text": "冰在上万人拉的滑板上运了七十公里土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00125",
      "start_ms": 337960,
      "end_ms": 339980,
      "text": "郭进城的有一个工城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00126",
      "start_ms": 340100,
      "end_ms": 341960,
      "text": "藏在地底下五千多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00127",
      "start_ms": 341960,
      "end_ms": 344900,
      "text": "长让火焰山边上长出了葡萄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00128",
      "start_ms": 345520,
      "end_ms": 349200,
      "text": "可坐在头把交椅上的那座没有一块砖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00129",
      "start_ms": 349440,
      "end_ms": 350520,
      "text": "没有一根铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00130",
      "start_ms": 350940,
      "end_ms": 352260,
      "text": "两千二百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00131",
      "start_ms": 352280,
      "end_ms": 353440,
      "text": "一天没写过到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00132",
      "start_ms": 353440,
      "end_ms": 355540,
      "text": "今天还在给上千万人供水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00133",
      "start_ms": 355920,
      "end_ms": 356680,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00134",
      "start_ms": 356920,
      "end_ms": 360200,
      "text": "他凭什么把故宫和长城都压下去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00135",
      "start_ms": 360640,
      "end_ms": 362720,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00136",
      "start_ms": 363320,
      "end_ms": 365420,
      "text": "现在直接点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00137",
      "start_ms": 365660,
      "end_ms": 366560,
      "text": "进入主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00138",
      "start_ms": 367240,
      "end_ms": 370515,
      "text": "他一条视频就是下一集点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_bd18b2e06ff50fb9_s00139",
      "start_ms": 371020,
      "end_ms": 375105,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国古代最不可思议的建筑。"
    }
  ],
